  m_Text: 'LEFT CONTROLLER

    Grip  Hold to pick up; release to place.

    X / Y  No villa action assigned.

    Menu  Open / close the room menu.


    RIGHT CONTROLLER

    Grip  Hold to pick up; release to place.

    A  Jump in the villa.

    B  No villa action assigned.


    BOTH CONTROLLERS

    Index trigger  Point and press for UI, doors,

    lights and POIs.

    Grip on POI  Open its information.'
